{"id":"proprium.dominica-iv-adventus-introitus","title":"Roráte, cæli, désuper","category":"proprium","section":"missa-catechumenorum","variant":"dominica-iv-adventus","sung":true,"st":"working-edition","ad":5,"adw":6,"about":{"pl":"Introit IV Niedzieli Adwentu, od którego cały adwentowy zwyczaj Rorat bierze nazwę. Antyfona wraca po psalmie i po Chwała Ojcu, tak jak każe rubryka pod nią.","en":"The introit of the Fourth Sunday of Advent, the antiphon the Roráte Masses of Advent are named from. It returns after the psalm verse and the Glória Patri, as the rubric under it directs."},"seg":[{"id":"s01","type":"verse","speaker":"schola","voice":"cantus","participation":{"lecta":{"gradus":4,"source":"DMS 31 d"},"cantu":{"gradus":3,"source":"DMS 25 c"}},"w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Roráte","l":"roro","p":",","m":158},{"i":"w002","f":"cæli","l":"caelum","p":",","m":369,"a":13},{"i":"w003","f":"désuper","l":"desuper","p":",","m":32},{"i":"w004","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w005","f":"nubes","l":"nubes","m":10},{"i":"w006","f":"pluant","l":"pluo","m":44},{"i":"w007","f":"iustum","l":"iustus","p":":","m":96,"s":true},{"i":"w008","f":"aperiátur","l":"aperio","m":404},{"i":"w009","f":"terra","l":"terra","p":",","m":24},{"i":"w010","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w011","f":"gérminet","l":"germino","m":33},{"i":"w012","f":"Salvatórem","l":"salvator","p":".","m":162}],"tr":{"pl":"Niebiosa, spuśćcie rosę z góry, a obłoki niech ześlą z deszczem Sprawiedliwego; niech otworzy się ziemia i wyda Zbawiciela.","en":"Drop down dew, O heavens, from above, and let the clouds rain down the Just One; let the earth open and bring forth the Savior."},"tc":{"pl":[354],"en":[101]},"g":{"pl":["spuszczajcie rosę","niebiosa","z góry","i","obłoki","niech spuszczą deszczem","Sprawiedliwego","niech się otworzy","ziemia","i","niech wyda","Zbawiciela"],"en":["drop down dew","ye heavens","from above","and","let the clouds","rain down","the Just One","let be opened","the earth","and","let it bud forth","the Savior"]},"fn":{"pl":{"w002":"Wołacz od „cælum”. Ten rzeczownik zmienia rodzaj wewnątrz własnej odmiany, z nijakiego na męski, więc wołacz brzmi cæli, a nie cæla."},"en":{"w002":"The vocative of cælum. The noun changes gender inside its own paradigm, from neuter to masculine, so the form is cæli and not cæla."}}},{"id":"s02","type":"verse","speaker":"schola","voice":"cantus","participation":{"lecta":{"gradus":4,"source":"DMS 31 d"},"cantu":{"gradus":3,"source":"DMS 25 c"}},"w":[{"i":"w013","f":"Cæli","l":"caelum","m":118,"a":13},{"i":"w014","f":"enárrant","l":"enarro","m":125},{"i":"w015","f":"glóriam","l":"gloria","m":141},{"i":"w016","f":"Dei","l":"deus","p":":","m":54},{"i":"w017","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w018","f":"ópera","l":"opus","m":128},{"i":"w019","f":"mánuum","l":"manus","m":409},{"i":"w020","f":"eius","l":"is","m":27},{"i":"w021","f":"annúntiat","l":"annuntio","m":119},{"i":"w022","f":"firmaméntum","l":"firmamentum","p":".","m":104}],"tr":{"pl":"Niebiosa opowiadają chwałę Boga, a firmament oznajmia dzieła Jego rąk.","en":"The heavens declare the glory of God, and the firmament proclaims the works of His hands."},"tc":{"pl":[354],"en":[101]},"g":{"pl":["niebiosa","opowiadają","chwałę","Boga","i","dzieła","rąk","Jego","oznajmia","firmament"],"en":["the heavens","declare","the glory","of God","and","the works","of hands","His","proclaims","the firmament"]}},{"id":"s03","type":"verse","speaker":"schola","voice":"cantus","participation":{"lecta":{"gradus":4,"source":"DMS 31 d"},"cantu":{"gradus":3,"source":"DMS 25 c"}},"w":[{"i":"w023","f":"Glória","l":"gloria","m":24},{"i":"w024","f":"Patri","l":"pater","p":",","m":179},{"i":"w025","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w026","f":"Fílio","l":"filius","p":",","m":180},{"i":"w027","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w028","f":"Spirítui","l":"spiritus","m":181},{"i":"w029","f":"Sancto","l":"sanctus","p":".","m":182,"h":"w028"},{"i":"w030","f":"Sicut","l":"sicut","m":15},{"i":"w031","f":"erat","l":"sum","m":183},{"i":"